The numbers is a list of 9, 4, 2, 10, 7, 8, 8, 1, and 9.
The rising is 0.
The falling is 0.
The best is 1.
For every spot from 1 to the last position of numbers.
The before is item (spot minus 1) of numbers.
The here is item spot of numbers.
If here is more than before, set rising to falling plus 1, set falling to 0.
If here is less than before, set falling to rising plus 1, set rising to 0.
If here is before, set rising to 0, set falling to 0.
If rising plus 1 is more than best, set best to rising plus 1.
If falling plus 1 is more than best, set best to falling plus 1.

Show best.
